{{Quote|It's an old smuggler's route. The pilots used to talk about it on Tatooine.|Anakin Skywalker, on the Balmorra Run|<ref name="Shadow of Malevolence">{{TCW|Shadow of Malevolence|Shadow of ''Malevolence''}}</ref>}}
The '''Balmorra Run''' was an old [[smuggler]]'s route that ran through the hazardous [[Kaliida Nebula]], which posed dangers to travelers due to the giant [[Realspace|space]]-dwelling [[neebray]] mantas that nested there. [[Anakin Skywalker]] and his [[Shadow Squadron]] took the route as a shortcut to intercept the [[Confederacy of Independent Systems|Separatist]] [[cruiser]] ''[[Malevolence]]'' under the command of [[General]] [[Grievous]] before it could attack the [[Kaliida Shoals Medical Center]] during the [[Clone Wars]].<ref name="Shadow of Malevolence" />

While traveling on the route, the group unexpectedly encountered the Neebray mantas nested there. [[Matchstick]]'s bomber sustained a minor chip after running into a manta and it later caused his bomber to explode when evading the ''Malevolence''{{'s}} [[ion cannon]].<ref name="Shadow of Malevolence" />

